DTSTAMP:20261124T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261103
SUMMARY:GitHub Actions: macOS 14 runner images are retired
DESCRIPTION:What happens: GitHub Actions will fully retire all macOS 14 ima
 ges on November 2\, 2026.\nWho: GitHub-hosted jobs on macos-14\, macos-14-
 large or macos-14-xlarge\nLast verified 2026-11-24
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/github-actions/macos-14-retiremen
 t/
