DTSTAMP:20261124T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270417
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270418
SUMMARY:GitHub Actions: Ubuntu 22.04 runner images are retired on April 17\
 , 2027
DESCRIPTION:What happens: Deprecation will begin on September 17th\, 2026 a
 nd the images will be fully unsupported by April 17th\, 2027.\nWho: GitHub
 -hosted jobs on ubuntu-22.04 or ubuntu-22.04-arm (brownouts fail some jobs
  before the retirement)\nLast verified 2026-11-24
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/github-actions/ubuntu-22.04-retir
 ement/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
